# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
*.local
venv/

# dist/ is NOT ignored on purpose: it's the built extension, so anyone who clones
# the repo can "Load unpacked" this folder in Chrome without building it first.

# Windows adds these "downloaded from the internet" stamps next to downloaded files.
# Their names contain ":", which breaks cloning the repo on Windows.
*:Zone.Identifier

